{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國兩大電影人James Gunn與Peter Safran 4年前宣布加盟DC影業擔任聯合主席務求大展拳腳，只可惜未能成功令DC招牌擦亮，多部超級英雄電影包括今夏的《超女》（Supergirl）票房成績強差人意。</p><p>而昨日兩人發表聯合聲明宣布</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.275758+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T00:16:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"90561999e57811337e269c1229467c87d49739e15d37361dc1d8d4dc827d11bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}